// │ L4.5 Causal Anchor (Deterministic Replay Layer)             │
// │      - enables replay from known valid state                │
// │      - replaces rollback heuristics with recomputation      │
// ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │ L5   Consensus Attractor Engine                              │
// │      - aligns distributed nodes on identical state hash      │
// │      - finality via convergence threshold                    │
