//
// FRAME:
//
// [tick: u64]
// [cmd_count: u32]
// [commands...]
// [state_hash: u64]
//
// PROPERTY:
// - fully deterministic replay
// - no floating ambiguity
// - byte-identical across platforms
//
// ============================================================================


// ============================================================================
// SYSTEM GUARANTEE MODEL (CORRECTED)
// ============================================================================
//
// L1: produces truth (state)
// L4: defines identity (hash)
// L5: detects convergence (NOT authority)
// L7–L9: analyze system health (NOT execution)
//
// FINAL RULE:
//
//    STATE is never derived from consensus.
//
//    CONSENSUS is derived from state.
//
// ============================================================================
